      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report herein a modification of the standard wirsungojejunostomy in patients with chronic pancreatitis, which includes concomitant duodenum-preserving resection of the head of the pancreas as described by Frey. This technique is safe and seems to provide more effective long-term pain relief than standard wirsungo-jejunal anastomosis."},
